        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. by September 5th, submit to the appropriate dean or director, or designee, a full file for evaluation, including a CV and, upon request of the dean or director, a list of two (2) external reviewers (no external reviews shall be requested for comprehensive retention reviews or any post-tenure reviews);",
