        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. at the option of the dean or director the file will be transmitted to the department head/chair by the next business day for evaluation. The file shall contain materials appropriate for the purpose of the review being conducted. For comprehensive post tenure review a unit member will submit only a complete CV and Annual Activity Reports in accordance with Article 9.2.4(a);",
