        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. if the department head/chair is requested to provide a written evaluation, the written evaluation shall be provided to the dean or director or designee by September 25. The unit member shall submit any comments in response to the department head/chair’s evaluation to the dean or director no later than October 1; and",
