        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. when an external review has been requested, distribute the unit member's curriculum vita to the two (2) external reviewers submitted by the unit member and up to two (2) additional external reviewers selected by the dean or director. The reviewers shall be requested to submit their reviews to the dean or director no later than October 1; and",
